    "retention_analysis": "<Video 1>: partially_preserved - green background, coin motion trajectory, rotation phases, timing and camera framing retained; original coin appearance removed.\n<Picture 1>: attribute_transfer - cat-face relief design and metallic style transferred to <Subject 1>.",
    "detailed_description": "Retain reference appearance. [Shot 1] A golden coin with cat-face relief design from <Picture 1> spins continuously against a solid green background, following the exact rotation trajectory, speed profile and camera framing of <Video 1>. The coin begins face-on, rotates through edge-on views and returns to face-on at the original phases across the full 3 seconds, ending in the same final orientation.",
